    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86598" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προᾰνύτω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ</span>], aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήνῠσα</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Eq.</u>
			1053
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>get forward
				in, achieve,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὧν χρῄζομεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					4.5.22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>accomplish before,</i> in 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ προανυσθὲν ὑπόμνημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					8.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.101
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				3.18
			</span></i>.</div>
